q3.zip`\n- Build tag: `MX2-ES-WV4.01-20250619`\n- Build date: 2025-06-19\n\n## Install\n\n1. Download `rom_q3.zip` (every numbered volume if the release has more than one, then `cat rom_q3.zip.* > rom_q3.zip`).\n2. Unzip it. Keep the scatter file next to the images.\n3. Open SP Flash Tool, choose **Download Only**, load the scatter file from the archive and flash.\n4. Or use Innioasis Updater CE: <https://innioasis.app/guide.html>\n\nThis wipes the player. Back up music and recordings first.\n\n## Files\n\n| File | Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| `rom_q3.zip` | 269.0 MB |\n| `SHA256SUMS` | 0.0 MB |\n\nFull archive: <https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?model=Q3>\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Q3\",\"name\":\"rom_q3-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"613daa2a9230d8200df0a2407aa19d7f4873211c42927d2e504b5495068177af\",\"size\":491463477,\"source_asset\":\"rom_q3.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Q3\",\"name\":\"rom_q3-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"ecec8bc7ce9a9672cde53cd4f9200d904f516b30923a6fd159d321303548e5e6\",\"size\":645583831,\"source_asset\":\"rom_q3.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Q3\",\"name\":\"rom_q3-linux-arm64.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux-arm64\",\"sha256\":\"a6f63a06899424769f93562e0a29f26c154f646cde2690868aab79bc5d7a8b5d\",\"size\":470488773,\"source_asset\":\"rom_q3.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Q3\",\"name\":\"rom_q3-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"fa2cd5ba3fd4d62fd1f66d90e253306d142bcbf177d5189375c5cd8d87e94342\",\"size\":405510793,\"source_asset\":\"rom_q3.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"}],\"built_at\":\"2026-11-10T21:28:58Z\",\"button_assets\":[{\"name\":\"release-button-updater.svg\",\"size\":1540},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows.svg\",\"size\":1522},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux.svg\",\"size\":1518},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux-arm64.svg\",\"size\":1510},{\"name\":\"release-button-macos.svg\",\"size\":1516}],\"failures\":[],\"fingerprint\":\"7e7810c99d2b38d75ef0bf3